  "title": "Service management: Import from CSV in the template gallery",
  "product": "Jira Service Management",
  "status": "rollout_complete",
  "description": "Jira Service Management now includes an Import into JSM (CSV) option directly within the Service management and Jira Service Management template gallery. This update allows teams to quickly set up a realistic project by importing historical tickets, users, and configurations from other service management tools. To get started with this change: Go to the Service management or Jira Service Management category in the template gallery.\n\tSelect Import into JSM (CSV).\n\tFollow the prompts in the import",
